.TH DT-MKFILE 1 "August 2026" "dirtoo tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dt-mkfile \- create empty regular files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dt-mkfile
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.I PATH\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create empty regular files at the given paths (touch-style creation via
dirops).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-dry\-run
.TQ
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
.TQ
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
.TQ
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dirtoo (1),
.BR dt-copy (1),
.BR dt-move (1),
.BR dt-rename (1),
.BR dt-rm (1),
.BR dt-mkdir (1),
.BR dt-filter (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Written for the dirtoo project.
